Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.86,0:23:34.78,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(983,0)\blur0.6\fnAnja Eliane\fs50\3c&HA120FF&\c&HA120FF&\bord3\1a&HFF&\t(938,983,\1a&H00&)\pos(640,540)}Fuwari dances! Her first concert!
