Dialogue: 9,0:00:00.95,0:00:02.14,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\i1}Special announcement!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:02.14,0:00:05.63,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\i1}The distinguished son of the Paprika Group, Shikyouin Hibiki-san,
Dialogue: 9,0:00:05.63,0:00:08.91,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\i1}returned from Europe yesterday.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:08.91,0:00:10.54,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\i1}While studying in Europe,
Dialogue: 9,0:00:10.54,0:00:13.42,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,he flourished as both a movie star and model.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:13.42,0:00:17.14,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,Many of his titles have been sold out, making him a legendary artist.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:17.14,0:00:19.94,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,I hope he stays here forever.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:20.76,0:00:22.32,Default-Alt,Rand1,0,0,0,,It's Shikyouin Hibiki!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:22.32,0:00:22.97,Default-Alt,Rand2,0,0,0,,The one from TV?!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:22.97,0:00:24.03,Default-Alt,Rand3,0,0,0,,Really? That movie star?!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:24.03,0:00:25.22,Default-Alt,Rand4,0,0,0,,W-Why is he coming to Paprika Academy?!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:25.22,0:00:26.32,Default-Alt,Rand5,0,0,0,,Hibiki!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:25.22,0:00:26.32,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:26.32,0:00:27.81,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:27.31,0:00:29.19,Default-Alt,Rand6,0,0,0,,Hibiki-sama, I love you!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:29.19,0:00:31.77,Default-Alt,Rand6,0,0,0,,Please marry me!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:41.99,0:00:43.44,Default-Alt,Rand7,0,0,0,,Hibiki-sama!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:43.44,0:00:44.95,Default-Alt,Rand8,0,0,0,,Look over here!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:42.46,0:00:44.95,Default-Alt,Rand9,0,0,0,,{\3c&HA13EA6&}Shikyouin-sama!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:47.01,0:00:50.14,Default-Alt,Rand10,0,0,0,,H-i-b-i-k-i-T-V!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:48.08,0:00:51.17,Default-Alt,Rand11,0,0,0,,{\3c&HA13EA6&}Hibiki-sama, you're so beautiful! You're mesmerising!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:51.17,0:00:53.41,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Pretty cool, isn't he, Leona?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:53.41,0:00:54.21,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:54.21,0:00:55.90,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Looks like he's rich, too.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:55.90,0:00:57.39,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,And probably smart as well.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:57.39,0:00:59.63,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,White, yet black. Even better.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:02.19,0:01:03.49,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Prince-sama...
Dialogue: 9,0:01:03.49,0:01:04.37,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:04.37,0:01:06.81,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That's your Prince-sama?!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:06.81,0:01:09.77,Default,Rand12,0,0,0,,But why has he shown up at our school?
Dialogue: 9,0:01:09.77,0:01:11.53,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Prince-sama!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:11.53,0:01:12.90,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,P-Prin...
Dialogue: 9,0:01:15.91,0:01:17.47,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Prince-sama...
Dialogue: 9,0:01:18.27,0:01:22.37,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,We have been awaiting your arrival, Shikyouin Hibiki-san.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:22.37,0:01:25.33,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It has been far too long, Miss Gloria.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:28.25,0:01:36.07,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,As a prince raised in Europe, you sure do know how to properly greet someone.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:36.07,0:01:37.14,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Right Rina-chwan?
Dialogue: 9,0:01:37.14,0:01:38.76,Default,Rina,0,0,0,,Right-puru!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:38.76,0:01:40.22,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'm honoured to be here.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:16.07,0:03:19.30,Default,Dono,0,0,0,,Prince-sama and the Blue Bird of Misfortune.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:20.50,0:03:22.94,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Students of Paprika Academy,
Dialogue: 9,0:03:22.94,0:03:26.91,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,I have an important announcement to make today.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:26.91,0:03:32.00,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Starting today, the distinguished son of the Paprika Group, Shikyouin Hibiki-san,
Dialogue: 9,0:03:32.00,0:03:35.41,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,will be attending our high school department for one year.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:35.41,0:03:36.83,Default-Alt,Rand1,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:36.83,0:03:41.28,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Hibiki-san has spent most of his time in Europe.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:41.28,0:03:44.80,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,However, he is the grandchild of the academy's chairman.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:45.32,0:03:46.76,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:46.76,0:03:50.97,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,As such, he has been given the position of acting principal.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:50.97,0:03:52.55,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Rina-chan, go!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:57.88,0:03:58.58,Default-Alt,Rand2,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:58.58,0:04:00.28,Default-Alt,Rand3,0,0,0,,Acting principal?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:00.28,0:04:01.11,Default-Alt,Rand4,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:01.11,0:04:02.65,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I didn't see this coming.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:02.65,0:04:03.65,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Me either.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:03.65,0:04:05.14,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:05.14,0:04:09.66,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Principal, isn't it strange to have a first year high school student be the acting principal?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:09.66,0:04:10.90,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Dorthy...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:10.90,0:04:12.79,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,It's not strange!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:12.79,0:04:13.66,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}That's because...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:13.66,0:04:15.33,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}That's because...?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:15.64,0:04:20.06,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,...he won the Mr. Hunky Universe Prince of the Year contest...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:20.06,0:04:24.79,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,...with his exquisite heart, technique, and physique expected of the ideal male,
Dialogue: 9,0:04:24.79,0:04:29.30,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,and has been crowned the ultimate prince by the queen of the three Plutoniean countries.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:31.26,0:04:34.03,Default,Rand5,0,0,0,,Since he's the ultimate prince,
Dialogue: 9,0:04:34.03,0:04:37.62,Default,Rand5,0,0,0,,our job will be to spend a whole year like a prince!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:37.62,0:04:40.54,Default,Rand6,0,0,0,,That means we get to ride in a horse-drawn carriage.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:40.54,0:04:41.48,Default,Rand7,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:42.33,0:04:43.73,Default,Fans,0,0,0,,This will be awesome!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:44.36,0:04:47.03,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Now then, everyone,
Dialogue: 9,0:04:47.03,0:04:52.20,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,let's do our best to be pure, righteous, and beautiful Paprika Academy students just like Hibiki-san.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:52.86,0:04:54.70,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Please take care of me.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:55.91,0:04:57.87,Default,Fans,0,0,0,,We'd be glad to!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:03.43,0:05:05.76,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Fuwari-chan?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:06.50,0:05:09.82,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Prince-sama didn't even notice me.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:09.82,0:05:12.18,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,He forgot all about me.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:15.63,0:05:17.43,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What's the big idea?!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:17.88,0:05:19.81,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Hey, what was that for?!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:20.36,0:05:21.28,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 9,0:05:21.96,0:05:23.27,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:23.56,0:05:25.80,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Ah, well...
Dialogue: 9,0:05:25.80,0:05:28.11,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You don't need to cry.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:28.11,0:05:29.24,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Was it what I said?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:29.24,0:05:30.70,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:31.01,0:05:32.66,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Fuwari-chan...
Dialogue: 9,0:05:36.12,0:05:39.12,Default,All,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:41.41,0:05:47.84,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,So you became PriPara's princess scholarship student because Shikyouin-san asked you to?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:47.84,0:05:49.10,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:49.10,0:05:53.34,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,But when you went to talk to him again, he didn't acknowledge you.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:53.34,0:05:57.78,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, what did he say when you first met him?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:58.51,0:06:01.13,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,When I met Prince-sama?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:03.44,0:06:12.95,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I was playing with the goat Yukino-chan and the other animals in the Palps like I always did.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:24.47,0:06:25.60,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:25.60,0:06:27.91,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do you want to sing with me?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:27.91,0:06:30.22,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}All animals are friends.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:31.19,0:06:32.65,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then let's sing together.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:36.04,0:06:37.26,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maxi.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:55.93,0:06:58.58,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}You have a beautiful voice.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:58.58,0:07:01.58,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}For Maxi to be attracted to someone other than me...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:01.58,0:07:03.84,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}You must have a pure heart.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:03.84,0:07:05.54,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not at all.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:05.90,0:07:10.21,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maxi suddenly ran off when I was letting him get a drink from the river.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:11.45,0:07:14.82,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perhaps he was attracted to your voice.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:15.53,0:07:17.22,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've never seen him run that fast.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:17.55,0:07:21.43,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry. I didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:22.39,0:07:23.66,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}No ending.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:24.39,0:07:28.84,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you're looking for somewhere to rest your horse, there's a place on the other side of that road.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:28.84,0:07:30.08,Default,Hibik,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's your name?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:30.08,0:07:30.86,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eh?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:32.03,0:07:33.75,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's Fuwari.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:33.75,0:07:35.32,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Midorikaze Fuwari.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:36.13,0:07:37.13,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fuwari...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:38.18,0:07:40.60,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your song was beautiful.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:40.60,0:07:42.82,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}It seems I've finally found what I've been looking for.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:42.82,0:07:43.41,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:44.11,0:07:45.95,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}My princess.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:52.98,0:07:55.47,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Wow! How romantic!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:55.47,0:07:59.39,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,If I was there, he would have said that to me!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:59.39,0:08:00.73,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,How wonderful.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:00.73,0:08:02.24,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It's the season of Koi.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:02.24,0:08:04.02,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But that looks like a Tai.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:04.02,0:08:07.26,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Though, he's right. Midorikaze-san's singing is beautiful.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:07.26,0:08:11.36,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,But I wonder if his heart was cleansed by her lack of a sentence ender?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:11.36,0:08:12.72,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:12.72,0:08:15.19,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Does that upset you, President Minami?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:15.19,0:08:17.15,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:17.15,0:08:20.12,Default,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Prez's pri is wonderful the way it is-bri.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:20.12,0:08:21.62,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,And then what?!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:21.62,0:08:23.17,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 9,0:08:24.66,0:08:28.72,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since I've been chosen as the ultimate prince,
Dialogue: 9,0:08:28.72,0:08:32.55,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've been searching for a suitable ultimate princess.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:33.09,0:08:34.52,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Princess?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:34.52,0:08:35.46,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:35.46,0:08:38.51,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}So please become my princess.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:39.02,0:08:42.74,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}And to do that, I would like you to go to PriPara on Parajuku St.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:44.62,0:08:50.36,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}You see, I believe that PriPara will bring forth the ultimate girl.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:52.15,0:08:54.90,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I said that, and asked her to come here.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:54.90,0:08:56.39,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:56.39,0:09:00.58,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,So by first winning the Summer Idol Dream GrandPrix,
Dialogue: 9,0:09:00.58,0:09:03.87,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,she'll be on her way to becoming the Princess of Summer.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:03.87,0:09:05.06,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:05.06,0:09:09.59,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll shine brighter than anyone else if we polish her.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:09.59,0:09:14.34,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I hear you've had a profound admiration for PriPara for quite some time, Miss Gloria.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:15.05,0:09:19.80,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,So please give Fuwari your utmost guidance and encouragement.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:21.17,0:09:22.93,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:22.93,0:09:28.39,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,So that's why Fuwari-chan came all the way to Paprika Academy.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:28.69,0:09:33.36,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,But it seems Prince-sama forgot about me.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:33.74,0:09:35.65,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What? You're burying your PriTicket?!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:35.65,0:09:38.57,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,If you do that, the ghost of wasting will come for you.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:38.57,0:09:40.28,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 9,0:09:40.28,0:09:43.99,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Your collar... pushuu~.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:44.35,0:09:45.61,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:47.19,0:09:48.79,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Looks like it's from Prince-sama.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:49.25,0:09:50.50,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:51.20,0:09:54.94,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fuwari, I was so busy I couldn't talk to you today.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:54.94,0:09:58.51,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}But once you've become an elegant princess, I'll come sweep you off your feet.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:58.51,0:09:59.47,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hibiki.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:00.43,0:10:03.03,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Prince-sama! I will!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:03.03,0:10:06.18,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to become an elegant princess!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:06.73,0:10:08.82,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Isn't that great, Fuwari-chan?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:08.82,0:10:12.14,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yeah! I can't wait to perform!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:12.80,0:10:16.65,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,The world is beautiful.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:16.99,0:10:19.63,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Wow. She really does have a lovely voice.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:19.63,0:10:20.61,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:20.61,0:10:22.58,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,{\an8}Time to be quick and decisive.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:22.58,0:10:26.58,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'll have to act fast and ask her to join Dressing Parfait's Dream Team.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:28.45,0:10:32.24,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but since we still can't find a brand for Fuwari-san,
Dialogue: 9,0:10:32.24,0:10:33.92,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,she can't have her début concert yet.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:33.92,0:10:35.50,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:35.50,0:10:36.94,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What's with that?!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:36.94,0:10:39.76,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Isn't everyone in PriPara an idol?!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:40.52,0:10:42.37,Default,Kosumo,0,0,0,,I'm cosmicly sorry!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:42.37,0:10:44.53,Default,Kosumo,0,0,0,,I'm buried under a teracosmic pile of work.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:44.53,0:10:46.97,Default,Kosumo,0,0,0,,But I'll do my super best to make something soon!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:47.31,0:10:48.18,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:48.18,0:10:49.68,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll leave it to you.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:50.08,0:10:51.70,Default,Kosumo,0,0,0,,Cosmic capisce!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:53.91,0:10:57.48,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,What's a manager?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:57.48,0:11:00.25,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You really don't know anything, do you?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:00.25,0:11:02.49,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Please allow me to explain-usa.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:02.49,0:11:03.95,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,T-T-Tori!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:05.32,0:11:06.41,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:06.41,0:11:08.12,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,T-T-T{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 9,0:11:09.40,0:11:10.33,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Fuwari.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:11.15,0:11:14.29,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,This is Dressing Parfait's manager, Usagi.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:14.29,0:11:15.72,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Usagi-san?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:15.72,0:11:16.80,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:16.80,0:11:20.52,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,A manager is a must-have for every idol here in PriPara.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:20.52,0:11:22.88,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,You could say their importance is akin to that of air-usa.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:23.70,0:11:27.00,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Animals wouldn't be able to live without air.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:27.00,0:11:30.10,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,So a manager is truly important.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:32.31,0:11:33.77,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,T-T{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 9,0:11:43.16,0:11:44.40,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I feel refreshed-kuma.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:44.74,0:11:46.03,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:46.03,0:11:49.57,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Is everyone as excited as I am-usa?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:01.84,0:12:03.88,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Ack! What's that?!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:03.88,0:12:06.72,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,There's a visible silhouette around it!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:07.08,0:12:08.80,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Who's that bird?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:08.80,0:12:10.93,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,That's Toriko-san-kuma.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:10.93,0:12:11.93,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Toriko-san?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:12.22,0:12:13.14,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma...
Dialogue: 9,0:12:13.14,0:12:15.35,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,And since she's drowning in misfortune,
Dialogue: 9,0:12:15.35,0:12:18.31,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,she has come to be known as the Blue Bird of Misfortune.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:19.05,0:12:21.19,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,T-The Blue Bird of Misfortune?!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:21.19,0:12:23.15,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa...
Dialogue: 9,0:12:23.15,0:12:26.65,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Misfortune seems to follow her wherever she goes-usa.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:26.65,0:12:28.12,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 9,0:12:28.12,0:12:31.60,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Because of that, everyone avoids her which means she's always alone-usa.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:31.60,0:12:33.62,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,So it's best not to associate with her-usa.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:33.62,0:12:37.58,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,But all animals are friends.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:37.58,0:12:40.54,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Toriko-san, let's become friends, too.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:40.99,0:12:42.00,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Tori...
Dialogue: 9,0:12:43.21,0:12:45.90,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,If you speak in bird I won't be able to understand you.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:46.97,0:12:49.55,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko can speak normally-tori.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:49.55,0:12:52.18,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko only brings misfortune to those around her-tori!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:53.31,0:12:54.64,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:55.13,0:12:58.38,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'd like to try talking to Toriko-san.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:58.85,0:13:01.31,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Ah, Fuwari-chan!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:03.35,0:13:05.32,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Toriko-san!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:05.32,0:13:07.28,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,She flew off in this direction.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:14.38,0:13:15.87,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Ah, over there!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:15.87,0:13:17.06,Default,All,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:18.43,0:13:19.50,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Huh? Where?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:19.50,0:13:20.58,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:20.58,0:13:22.29,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,She must have hawk eyes.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:22.58,0:13:24.55,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Toriko-san!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:27.19,0:13:28.74,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Lightning out of nowhere?!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:28.74,0:13:30.49,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,This sure is some strange weather...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:30.49,0:13:32.01,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:32.01,0:13:33.72,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Porapora.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:34.99,0:13:36.21,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:36.21,0:13:38.27,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:38.27,0:13:39.91,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Washbin lightning?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:39.91,0:13:41.62,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,We're really having some strange weather...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:41.62,0:13:42.94,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:42.94,0:13:44.10,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,See!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:44.10,0:13:47.31,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,I told you that Toriko brings misfortune to those that go near her-tori!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:47.31,0:13:50.36,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm hardheaded.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:51.80,0:13:55.33,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Did you come here with the thought of eating Toriko?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:55.33,0:13:57.31,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Making grilled bird out of me-tori?!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:57.31,0:13:59.54,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'd like it with sauce and salt-tori!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:00.05,0:14:01.68,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:01.68,0:14:03.50,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I want to be friends.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:03.50,0:14:06.18,Default-Alt,Toriko,0,0,0,,You say you want to be friends,
Dialogue: 9,0:14:06.18,0:14:11.47,Default-Alt,Toriko,0,0,0,,but as soon as I let my guard down,\Nyou'll end up making fried bird out of me!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:07.72,0:14:11.47,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Wow. She's always thinking negatively.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:11.47,0:14:12.99,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Happy go lucky!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:12.99,0:14:16.93,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I believe if you laugh and have fun, happiness will follow.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:16.93,0:14:17.43,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:18.21,0:14:20.74,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Laugh, you say?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:23.02,0:14:24.78,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,That's quite a dark laugh you have there...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.78,0:14:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorthy...
Dialogue: 9,0:14:27.77,0:14:29.95,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,That's right, Toriko is Toriko.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:29.95,0:14:32.57,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Living alone in the darkness suits Toriko the best-tori.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:33.29,0:14:34.53,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Ah, wait!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:36.00,0:14:37.49,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Toriko-san!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:37.49,0:14:38.79,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Please wait up!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:42.78,0:14:43.92,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Tori?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:45.01,0:14:46.55,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Tori?!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:50.84,0:14:52.88,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Like Toriko said-tori.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:52.88,0:14:56.18,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Misfortune falls upon those who come near her-tori.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:57.80,0:15:00.77,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Ack, she's floating away-tori!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:00.77,0:15:04.10,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,G-Grab ahold of this-tori!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:04.10,0:15:05.23,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:07.06,0:15:07.82,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Tori!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:07.82,0:15:09.00,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:09.00,0:15:11.65,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko can't swim-tori!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:13.86,0:15:15.84,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:15.84,0:15:21.68,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,May this Toriko of Misfortune be released from her calamity, and become a star up in the sky.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:31.85,0:15:32.92,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:33.43,0:15:35.03,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have-tori.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:35.03,0:15:37.15,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,You should leave Toriko behind-tori.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:37.15,0:15:39.99,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Otherwise more misfortune will befall you-tori.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:39.99,0:15:41.70,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,That won't happen.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:44.93,0:15:45.98,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,They're coming-tori!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:45.98,0:15:48.31,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,The demons of misfortune have come to take us away-tori!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:48.31,0:15:50.31,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Just {\i1}who{\i0} are demons of misfortune?!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:50.31,0:15:51.14,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:51.14,0:15:54.53,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Blue Bird of Misfortune really does suit you!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:54.98,0:15:59.87,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,However, because of all this, I've been able to get closer to you, Toriko-san.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:00.83,0:16:01.98,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Why-tori?!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:01.98,0:16:04.20,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Why won't you leave Toriko alone-tori?!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:04.59,0:16:07.42,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,That's because all animals are friends.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:08.88,0:16:12.59,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Since we both got soaked in the same river, we're already friends.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:12.59,0:16:16.59,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,You really... won't come to hate Toriko?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:17.12,0:16:18.30,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:19.41,0:16:21.76,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to be friends with Toriko?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:22.81,0:16:23.97,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:23.97,0:16:26.69,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Even if misfortune befalls you?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:27.47,0:16:28.89,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,That won't happen.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:32.56,0:16:34.35,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,I've decided-tori!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:34.35,0:16:38.90,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko will be your manager-tori!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:39.63,0:16:41.70,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm Midorikaze Fuwari.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:41.70,0:16:43.35,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I look forward to working with you.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:43.35,0:16:45.41,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Same here-tori.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:45.41,0:16:46.99,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Fuwari...
Dialogue: 9,0:16:48.37,0:16:50.33,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Let me give you your PriPass-tori.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:50.33,0:16:53.47,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,With this, you've become a PriPara idol-tori!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:53.47,0:16:55.93,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,That's ancient! Does it even work?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:56.54,0:16:59.38,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Well, Toriko has never been a manager before...
Dialogue: 9,0:16:59.38,0:17:02.26,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Actually, it would be better if you didn't{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 9,0:17:02.85,0:17:04.81,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thanks, Toriko-san.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:07.30,0:17:08.39,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Tori!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:08.68,0:17:10.94,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,And this case is closed peacefully!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:10.94,0:17:11.61,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:11.61,0:17:12.95,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:11.61,0:17:12.95,Default-Alt,Toriko,0,0,0,,Tori!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:15.44,0:17:18.37,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:19.07,0:17:21.53,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:22.24,0:17:24.13,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:27.97,0:17:29.55,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:29.55,0:17:32.90,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It's finally time for everyone to see Dressing Parfait's ninja coord!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:32.90,0:17:33.87,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Nin! Nin!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:33.87,0:17:34.88,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,In The Water Coord!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:35.27,0:17:36.42,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:37.96,0:17:39.95,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Even though they're ninjas, they want to stand out!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:39.95,0:17:43.44,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,They're going against the grain and using vibrant colours!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:43.44,0:17:44.27,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Nin! Nin!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:44.27,0:17:45.72,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,In the Woods Coord!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:45.72,0:17:46.93,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:49.03,0:17:53.11,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,And let's dance with a fluttering scarf completely covered in hearts!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:53.55,0:17:54.63,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Nin! Nin!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:54.63,0:17:55.77,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,In the Fire Coord!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:16.15,0:19:19.48,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,660)}Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:24.39,0:19:25.32,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,660)}Drums!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:29.94,0:19:31.21,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,660)}Guitar!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:34.79,0:19:36.28,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,660)}Bass!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:37.29,0:19:41.24,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Stereo at full blast! 2x3 Rock!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:41.24,0:19:43.74,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,660)}Let's Go!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:45.59,0:19:48.58,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,660)}Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:54.14,0:19:55.56,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,660)}Go!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:31.60,0:20:33.83,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,The three of them shine so brightly.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:33.83,0:20:36.06,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It really gets me excited!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:36.06,0:20:37.54,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:37.54,0:20:39.03,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Way to Go!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:40.57,0:20:43.36,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything today.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:43.36,0:20:46.32,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I just can't wait to début!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:46.75,0:20:48.32,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Then let's snap!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:49.65,0:20:53.03,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I don't have any more PriTickets.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:53.03,0:20:54.94,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I did it with Lala yesterday.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:54.94,0:20:55.58,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:55.87,0:20:58.08,Default-Alt,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You shouldn't snap your PriTicket with them!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:58.08,0:21:00.58,Default-Alt,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You would've been much better off snapping with us.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:56.41,0:20:59.21,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,We're looking forward to your début, Fuwari-chan!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:59.21,0:20:59.98,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:00.58,0:21:02.35,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:02.35,0:21:04.32,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I guess you'll be waiting too, Toriko-san.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:04.32,0:21:07.71,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,I've never heard of an idol without a brand-tori.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:07.71,0:21:11.55,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko really is the Bird of Misfortune-tori!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:19.98,0:21:23.15,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Sweet dreams, Prince-sama.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:24.40,0:21:27.70,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Good night, Toriko-san.
Dialogue: 9,0:23:06.01,0:23:09.10,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Fuwari-chan, your princess training looks intense.
Dialogue: 9,0:23:09.10,0:23:10.46,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,But I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 9,0:23:10.46,0:23:13.43,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I want to live up to Hibiki-sama's expectation.
Dialogue: 9,0:23:13.43,0:23:14.68,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Big news!
Dialogue: 9,0:23:14.68,0:23:18.35,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,The new brand we've been waiting for has finally been finished!
Dialogue: 9,0:23:18.35,0:23:20.74,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That means you can finally have your concert!
Dialogue: 9,0:23:20.74,0:23:21.55,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 9,0:23:21.55,0:23:23.22,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I want to stand on stage as soon as I can!
Dialogue: 9,0:23:23.22,0:23:25.56,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Toriko's so excited that her heart might stop beating!
Dialogue: 9,0:23:25.56,0:23:27.77,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Toriko'll be grilled bird soon-tori!
Dialogue: 9,0:23:28.55,0:23:29.49,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Next time:
